OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers at
OL,6,Ffirst, heavy in places, but these
OL,7,Fdying out through the evening.
OL,8,FRemaining cloudy overnight with more
OL,9,Fshowers moving into the west. Mainly
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA cloudy morning with showers
OL,13,Fspreading east, some possibly heavy.
OL,14,FBecoming drier and brighter in the
OL,15,Fafternoon, then outbreaks of rain
OL,16,Freaching the west later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
